WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Use an existing QA order. Do not create a new paid order only for filming. Open Delivery information on the order screen.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Normal staff need Product, Fulfilment, Delivery method, Delivery option, Estimated delivery, Delivery charge, and Status. These describe what the customer bought and how delivery was recorded.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Normal staff do not need technical metadata. If you only see confusing technical details, stop and ask an administrator or technical support.
